WEBVTT

00:00:03.263 --> 00:00:08.875
On a live call, the Active interaction panel in My workspace shows Collect data securely.

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:12.952
It appears only when the setting is on and the agent's role has

00:00:12.952 --> 00:00:17.323
the permission to initiate secure capture, which the Agent role has.

00:00:17.835 --> 00:00:19.935
Click Collect data securely.

00:00:19.935 --> 00:00:24.196
The workspace shows a one-time link to share with the customer.

00:00:24.196 --> 00:00:29.815
Send it by text message, email or chat, whichever channel you already have with them.

00:00:30.307 --> 00:00:33.401
Only one capture can run on a call at a time.

00:00:33.401 --> 00:00:38.678
When the phone provider can pause recording, the recording stays paused while the

00:00:38.678 --> 00:00:42.074
customer types, and resumes when the capture ends.

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:46.987
The provider of this demo site is unreachable, so nothing is recorded here.

